      "message": "Release pass: remove the review label of a released hold\n\nLead, 2026-10-24 (issue #56 stayed labelled after its release closed it): a\nreleased hold no longer waits for review. After the merge or the close, the\nrelease pass removes verification-needs-review. On later passes, an approved\nitem that is already closed as released (a merged PR, or an issue closed as\ncompleted) loses the label too, so a failed removal is repaired. A 404 (the\nlabel is already gone) is not an error. pr_submissions uses the same constant.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
